.\" Manual page for harbourctl
.TH HARBOURCTL 1 "November 2025" "harbour-tools 1.4" "Harbour Commands"
.SH NAME
harbourctl \- control the Saltmere harbour lights and gates
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B harbourctl
[\fB\-v\fR]
\fIcommand\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B harbourctl
switches the harbour lights and opens or closes the tide gates.
.SS Commands
.TP
.B lights on|off
Switch the lights.
.TP
.B gate open|close
Move the tide gate.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
harbourctl gate close
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tidewatch (8)
.UR https://board.example.org/tools
Harbour tools
.UE
